Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Flopping has been a technical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:01.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}foul in the NBA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:02.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}since twenty twenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:03.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}But NBC Sports
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:04.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}calls the enforcement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.21,0:00:05.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}inconsistent at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:05.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Now the NBA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}has posted a video
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}of last season's flops,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:08.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}and says refs
