Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:09.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}The test is STEM:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:11.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}secondary, theatrical,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:11.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}exaggerated movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:12.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}But there's a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:13.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}The NBA is also
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}cracking down on push-offs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:15.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Thunder coach Mark Daigneault
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}says if defenders know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:17.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}they might
