Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}to bait those calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:21.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}A head snap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:21.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}isn't a flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Neither is Pascal Siakam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:24.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}sitting down after a jumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:25.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Reacting to contact is legal.
